cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Pen2STEP or Pen2STEP-Bench, please cite the following."
title: "Pen2STEP: Training-Free Conversion of Hand-Drawn Engineering Sketches to Parametric CAD Models using a Frozen Vision-Language Model"
abstract: >-
  Pen2STEP is a training-free pipeline that converts a photograph of a hand-drawn
  multi-view engineering sheet into an editable parametric CAD model exported to STEP,
  by wrapping a frozen open-weight vision-language model in a deterministic engineering
  shell. The repository also contains Pen2STEP-Bench, a dimension-annotated benchmark
  with 19 hand-drawn sheets and verified ground-truth solids.
type: software
